Value Required PORT (Gi\d+/\d+|FastEthernet\d+/\d+)
Value NO (\d+)
Value VLAN (\d+)
Value MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value TYPE (Dynamic|Static)
Value REMAINING_AGE (\d+|-)

Start
  ^NO\.\s+VLAN\s+MacAddress.*RemainingAge -> Continue
  ^-+\s+-+\s+-+
  ^${NO}\s+${VLAN}\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PORT}\s+${REMAINING_AGE} -> Record
